    <Description>RoseLeDark.Collections.Missings — Updated Description
A lightweight extension library providing additional generic collection types and utility structures missing in .NET.
Includes Vector&lt;T&gt;, FixedVector&lt;T&gt;, SortedArray&lt;T&gt;, Map&lt;TKey,TValue&gt;, SortedMap&lt;TKey,TValue&gt;, MultiMap&lt;TKey,TValue&gt;, Deque&lt;T&gt;, RingBuffer&lt;T&gt;, and tuple‑like helpers such as Pair&lt;T1,T2&gt; and Triple&lt;T1,T2,T3&gt;.

Provides extended numeric and color types including ColorRGB8, ColorRGB10, ColorRGB16, ColorHDR, ColorXYZ, and a unified Colors utility module.
Adds lightweight hash implementations for non‑cryptographic scenarios, supporting deterministic hashing for engine‑oriented data structures.

Designed as a minimal, allocation‑controlled complement to .NET’s built‑in collections, focusing on predictable behavior, simple APIs, and practical data structures commonly found in other ecosystems.</Description>
